-[A2] If $X$ is Banach then $X^*=\mathcal B(X,\mathbb K)$ is Banach ([[thm-bounded-operator-space-is-banach|Bounded operators into a Banach space form a Banach space]], [[def-dual-space-of-a-normed-space]], [[cor-finite-dimensional-normed-spaces-are-banach]]), and a closed subset of a Banach space is complete (claim 2 of [[thm-complete-subspace-iff-closed]], [[def-banach-space]]).
